  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing access to education on human rights and peace in Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Pyin-Nya-Man-Daing Programme is to ensure continuity of higher education in human rights, democracy and peace &#x2013; during the continued political crisis and for the development of the next generation of Myanmar academics at tertiary institutions and civil society actors in human rights and stakeholders in community justice and dispute resolution.</narrative>
  </description>
